{"title":"Gear Up for Foul-Weather Riding","link":"https://bikerumor.com/gear-up-for-foul-weather-riding/","date":1791552520000,"content":"<p><img src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_MT500_E8912GMG_E9409BLK-copy-1536x1024.jpg\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"(photos/Endura)\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Endura’s Scottish homeland gets every kind of weather, even sunshine.</strong> Far more common, though, are the seemingly infinite combinations of blustery, bracing, and wet that give the Scots language its uncommonly rich collection of weather words. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>We should expect nothing less of a country ribbed with ancient hills reminiscent of Appalachia, flowing into rugged seascapes worthy of Coastal California, and bathed in the light-sucking drizzle of Southeast Alaska. Cyclists, of course, will recognize all those places for their world-class roads, gravel and singletrack. Which brings us to the quandary that gave us Endura’s lineup of foul-weather kit: When the trail is braw, but the weather is dreich, what is a cyclist to do? </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Suit up and ride, of course*. With the proper Endura kit you’ll finish your trail day well and fully chuffed, and nae the least bit oorlich.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>*<em>Assuming the trails aren’t closed; always follow the direction of your local trail Org.</em></p>\n\n\n\n<h3><strong>AllTrack Race Cape</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/jacket-2-1-scaled.jpg\"><img width=\"2560\" height=\"1700\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/jacket-2-1-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/jacket-2-1-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/jacket-2-1-297x197.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/jacket-2-1-1536x1020.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/jacket-2-1-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/jacket-2-1-768x510.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/jacket-2-1-2048x1360.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/jacket-2-1-1355x900.jpg 1355w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The <strong>AllTrack Race Cape </strong>packs serious rain protection into an ultralight shell built for road and gravel duty. How serious? The cape sports a 20,000mm waterproof rating, which is how scientists say it can hold back a 65-foot column of water. That plus fully taped seams means this compact and packable bit of foul weather kit goes anywhere and is ready for anything. </p>\n\n\n<a href=\"https://rei.pxf.io/c/2227671/1448521/17195?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.rei.com%2Fproduct%2FC09662%2Fendura-alltrack-race-cape-mens\" target=\"_blank\">Shop Now</a>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<h3><strong>SingleTrack Windproof Glove </strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/gloves-scaled.jpg\"><img width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/gloves-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/gloves-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/gloves-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/gloves-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/gloves-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/gloves-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/gloves-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/gloves-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/gloves-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/gloves-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The <strong>SingleTrack Windproof Glove</strong> blocks the chill with a softshell backhand and lightly brushed lining for knuckle protection without bulky insulation. A zero-padding synthetic-leather palm and silicone grip preserve bar feel, while the Velcro cuff locks down the fit.</p>\n\n\n<a href=\"https://rei.pxf.io/c/2227671/1448521/17195?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.rei.com%2Fproduct%2F249759%2Fendura-singletrack-windproof-bike-gloves-mens\" target=\"_blank\">Shop Now</a>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<h3><strong>Endura AllTrack Rout Pant</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_E8911GGR_L1-copy-scaled.jpg\"><img width=\"2560\" height=\"1708\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_E8911GGR_L1-copy-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_E8911GGR_L1-copy-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_E8911GGR_L1-copy-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_E8911GGR_L1-copy-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_E8911GGR_L1-copy-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_E8911GGR_L1-copy-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_E8911GGR_L1-copy-2048x1366.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_E8911GGR_L1-copy-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_E8911GGR_L1-copy-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_E8911GGR_L1-copy-1349x900.jpg 1349w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Built for riders who don’t need their trail pants painted on, the <strong>AllTrack Rout Pant</strong> uses four-way stretch fabric and a relaxed fit with room for knee pads. Articulated, tapered legs keep things pedal-friendly, while a DWR finish, adjustable waist, and zipped pockets handle everyday trail duty.</p>\n\n\n<a href=\"https://rei.pxf.io/c/2227671/1448521/17195?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.rei.com%2Fproduct%2FC12740%2Fendura-alltrack-rout-bike-pants-mens\" target=\"_blank\">Shop Now</a>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<h3><strong>Endura AllTrack Roam WP Jacket</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_RE9405GMG_E8911GGR_E3267BST-copy-scaled.jpg\"><img width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_RE9405GMG_E8911GGR_E3267BST-copy-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_RE9405GMG_E8911GGR_E3267BST-copy-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_RE9405GMG_E8911GGR_E3267BST-copy-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_RE9405GMG_E8911GGR_E3267BST-copy-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_RE9405GMG_E8911GGR_E3267BST-copy-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_RE9405GMG_E8911GGR_E3267BST-copy-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_RE9405GMG_E8911GGR_E3267BST-copy-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_RE9405GMG_E8911GGR_E3267BST-copy-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_RE9405GMG_E8911GGR_E3267BST-copy-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_RE9405GMG_E8911GGR_E3267BST-copy-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The AllTrack Roam WP Jacket adds a bombproof outer layer to <a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/update-your-ride-anywhere-kit-with-endura-alltrack-cycling-clothing/\">Endura’s AllTrack line</a> of relaxed ride-anything-anytime gear. Stretch construction gives you room to move on technical trails, keeping the rain and smirr at bay without the restrictive feel of a race shell. </p>\n\n\n<a href=\"https://rei.pxf.io/c/2227671/1448521/17195?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.rei.com%2Fproduct%2FC09675%2Fendura-alltrack-roam-waterproof-jacket-mens\" target=\"_blank\">Shop Men’s</a>\n\n\n<a href=\"https://rei.pxf.io/c/2227671/1448521/17195?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.rei.com%2Fproduct%2FC09678%2Fendura-alltrack-roam-waterproof-jacket-womens\" target=\"_blank\">Shop Women’s</a>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<h3><strong>Endura MT500 Burner Fleece </strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Endura-fleece-scaled.jpg\"><img width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Endura-fleece-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Endura-fleece-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Endura-fleece-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Endura-fleece-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Endura-fleece-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Endura-fleece-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Endura-fleece-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Endura-fleece-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Endura-fleece-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Endura-fleece-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>More technical midlayer than bulky winter top, the <strong>MT500 Burner Fleece</strong> warms your upper body and sleeves with Polartec Alpha insulation. Pit zips dump excess heat, while the four-way stretch and relaxed Roam fit give you freedom to move when the trails get touzie.</p>\n\n\n<a href=\"https://rei.pxf.io/c/2227671/1448521/17195?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.rei.com%2Fproduct%2FC09656%2Fendura-mt500-burner-insulated-bike-fleece-mens\" target=\"_blank\">Shop Now</a>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<h3><strong>Endura MT500 Roam Insulated Jacket</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_MT500_E8139GCA_E9409BST_GLOVE-copy-scaled.jpg\"><img width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_MT500_E8139GCA_E9409BST_GLOVE-copy-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_MT500_E8139GCA_E9409BST_GLOVE-copy-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_MT500_E8139GCA_E9409BST_GLOVE-copy-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_MT500_E8139GCA_E9409BST_GLOVE-copy-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_MT500_E8139GCA_E9409BST_GLOVE-copy-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_MT500_E8139GCA_E9409BST_GLOVE-copy-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_MT500_E8139GCA_E9409BST_GLOVE-copy-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_MT500_E8139GCA_E9409BST_GLOVE-copy-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_MT500_E8139GCA_E9409BST_GLOVE-copy-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_MT500_E8139GCA_E9409BST_GLOVE-copy-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>For those pure Baltic trail days, the <strong>MT500 Roam Insulated Jacket</strong> backs up a two-layer, water-repellent DWR outer with breathable Polartec Alpha insulation. Underarm vents allow excess heat to escape, while articulated sleeves, roomy front pockets, and an adjustable hood make this a versatile layer for those unforgettable winter rips.</p>\n\n\n<a href=\"https://rei.pxf.io/c/2227671/1448521/17195?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.rei.com%2Fproduct%2FC09674%2Fendura-mt500-roam-insulated-bike-jacket-mens\" target=\"_blank\">Shop Now</a>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<h3><strong>AllTrack Roam Fleece</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_E3267BST-copy-scaled.jpg\"><img width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_E3267BST-copy-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Endura fleece\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_E3267BST-copy-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_E3267BST-copy-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_E3267BST-copy-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_E3267BST-copy-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_E3267BST-copy-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_E3267BST-copy-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_E3267BST-copy-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_E3267BST-copy-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ENDURA_AW26_ALLTRACKROUT_E3267BST-copy-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Constructed of breathable fabric and a soft fleece interior, the <strong>AllTrack Roam Fleece</strong> wraps you in a warm embrace without smothering hard efforts, while articulated sleeves maintain riding mobility. A relaxed Roam fit and zippered valuables pocket provide the sort of style and practicality that will make this midlayer a favorite on and off the bike. </p>\n\n\n<a href=\"https://rei.pxf.io/c/2227671/1448521/17195?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.rei.com%2Fproduct%2FC09655%2Fendura-alltrack-roam-fleece-cycling-jersery-mens\" target=\"_blank\">Shop Now</a>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<h3><strong>Endura AllTrack Ride L/S Jersey </strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AllTrack-Ride-LS-scaled.jpg\"><img width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AllTrack-Ride-LS-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AllTrack-Ride-LS-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AllTrack-Ride-LS-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AllTrack-Ride-LS-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AllTrack-Ride-LS-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AllTrack-Ride-LS-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AllTrack-Ride-LS-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AllTrack-Ride-LS-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AllTrack-Ride-LS-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AllTrack-Ride-LS-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Part jersey, part adventure shirt, the <strong>AllTrack Ride L/S</strong> blends a lightweight merino-knit body with stretchy ripstop sleeves for added trail durability. Articulated sleeves improve riding fit, while three rear drop-in pockets and a zippered security pocket provide road-jersey utility without the road-racer aesthetic.</p>\n\n\n<a href=\"https://rei.pxf.io/c/2227671/1448521/17195?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.rei.com%2Fproduct%2FC09660%2Fendura-alltrack-ride-long-sleeve-cycling-jersey-mens\" target=\"_blank\">Shop Men’s</a>\n\n\n<a href=\"https://rei.pxf.io/c/2227671/1448521/17195?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.rei.com%2Fproduct%2FC09665%2Fendura-alltrack-ride-long-sleeve-cycling-jersey-womens\" target=\"_blank\">Shop Women’s</a>\n\n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n\n<p><em>This article is sponsored by <a href=\"https://www.endurasport.com/\">Endura. </a></em></p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>","author":"Staff","comments":"https://bikerumor.com/gear-up-for-foul-weather-riding/#respond","siteTitle":"Bikerumo